                <pb facs="0559" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1877/pg511"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proposed law approving a decree of Governor-General
                        Malcampo, of November</hi> 21, 1876, <hi rendition="#italic">combining in
                        one the harbor, navigation, and other dues in the Philippines.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center">[From the Gaceta de Madrid, May 24, 1877.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">royal decree.</hi></p>
                <p>In subjection to the decree of the 29th of March last, and in accord with the
                    council of ministers,</p>
                <p>I hereby authorize the minister of ultramar to present to the Cortes the project
                    of law consolidating the port and navigation dues in the Philippine Islands.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given in the <placeName type="venue"
                            >Palace</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1877-05-18">May
                            18, 1877</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>ALFONSO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The Minister of Ultramar,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cristóbal Martin de
                            Herrera.</hi></p>
                </postscript>




